{"server":"tw","storyId":"act14side_level_act14side_08_end","groupId":"act14side","stageId":"act14side_08","title":"將軍","storyCode":"BI-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act14side/level_act14side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"1808e5589ea338ab77b22e6db7ea1c1032beb975db98bb417991728fc4200c1d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g13_mountpath_s"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是薩爾貢宮廷的人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"......上一份工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"想不到你能認出薩爾貢的劍術。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對法術不感興趣，但是和兵器有關的東西，想忘都難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪黑騎士被稱作天生的武者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道，從“不會使用法術的萊塔尼亞殘次品”，到“天生的武者”需要花費多長的時間？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你沒有痛覺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當你在童年的時候，每天除了睡眠就是忍受痛楚，你也會習慣這種感覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，你有多少次與死亡擦肩而過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"在戰爭中，我所知道的有心思去數的人都活不長久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說，黑騎士因為不願意與商業聯合會合作，以三屆冠軍之身，遭到流放與追殺，最終消失在卡西米爾邊境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"曾經不畏強權的象徵，如今卻以陰謀家的保鏢身份，參與篡奪一個國家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"我不做道德評判，但我也覺得有些遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為，你們羅德島應該理解恩希歐迪斯的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"理解是理解，接受是另一碼事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"實際上，我認為博士是理解恩希歐迪斯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不打算替恩希歐迪斯和自己辯解什麼，太麻煩了，也沒那個必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用你的雙眼親自去確認他到底想幹什麼吧——如果你活過今天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g2_temple_indoor"},{"type":"narration","text":"幾經艱險，恩希亞終於爬到了懸崖邊，下一秒她就可以攀登上去，就在這時，不遠處傳來的交談聲，讓她停住了手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，山下亂成一鍋粥，山上也亂成一鍋粥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，大長老居然就那麼倒下了，下面阿克托斯又帶人殺上來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來以為接下來已經不會有大事發生了，這下我完全不知道事情會變成什麼樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是一開始就沒覺得這下就安生了，只是，事情變成現在這樣，感覺有點難過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自從我們進駐蔓珠院以來，大小姐，呸，聖女大人明顯掌握了主動權。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大長老倒下後，現在整個蔓珠院已經完全聽聖女大人的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而山下，恩希歐迪斯老爺也在掌控全域。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這麼一說，還真是。山上，是聖女大人，山下，是恩希歐迪斯老爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用你的話說就是，這下我完全不知道事情會變成什麼樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們做下人的，想這些也沒什麼用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，想這些又有什麼用呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再轉兩圈吧，說不定等一會兒我們也要被喊下山了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......姐姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g11_snowylane"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士C","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，怎麼了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士D","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糧倉著火了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士C","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！快去救火！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，輕輕鬆鬆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布朗陶家戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是休露絲夫人，真是有您風格的做法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你什麼意思？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布朗陶家戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒，我這是誇您呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，事成之後我再出錢給他們重建一座糧倉就是了，現在事急從權！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別磨磨蹭蹭的了，趁著他們被火災轉移了注意力，關押尤卡坦的地方就在前面了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布朗陶家戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g2_temple_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......雅兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在，聖女大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大典的時候，我記得我在人群中偶然看到你時，你的身邊還有一個戴著兜帽的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從其他人口中聽說，這個人似乎就是恩希歐迪斯請來的羅德島貴客，人們都叫他博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同時，也是現在站在阿克托斯那邊，與恩希歐迪斯對抗的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......瞞不過聖女大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎麼認識他的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下山幫您送信時，偶然認識的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我就當是這麼一回事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您怎麼忽然提起這個人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想見一見他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知道是出於什麼理由，但他旗幟鮮明地站在了恩希歐迪斯的對立面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想要知道他的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經不再懷疑自己想要做什麼，但我害怕我決定得有些太晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要爭取一些東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於這一點......您倒是不必擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為他的使者已經在您背後了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亞......看來我終於出現幻覺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，姐姐，我不是幻覺，我真的是你的妹妹恩希亞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！恩希亞，真的是你嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我呀，姐姐，不信你摸摸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"恩雅想要用顫抖著的雙手去觸碰眼前的恩希亞。\n她生怕忽然出現的妹妹是虛假的。\n而不等她的手碰到恩希亞，恩希亞已經一頭紮進了她的懷裡。\n她立刻確認了，懷中的人，確實是自己最親愛的妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是你，恩希亞。真的是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，我好想你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也很想你，恩希亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在外面過得還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的病怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫羅德島的地方是個怎樣的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，姐姐，你這些問題不都在信上問過了嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽我說......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g13_mountpath_s"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Sharp倒退了幾步，微微吐了一口氣。\n他生涯之中遭遇過許多對手，羅德島上的諸多強者他也切磋過，或者至少觀察過。\n他必須承認，自己沒有見過鐧這樣的對手，或者說，鐧這樣純粹的對手。\n速度與力量，每個戰士都應當具備的素質。\n鐧沒有除此以外的東西，但她顯然也不需要除此以外的東西。\n當一個人擁有凌駕於絕大多數人的力量與速度時，他為什麼還需要別的東西？\n所幸......Sharp能夠成為精英幹員，也是因為這兩樣東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"你很信任恩希歐迪斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼這麼說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"很少有人為了錢能夠做到這一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，本來就不是能用錢說動的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？嘴上說著只是為了工作，但你做的事已經超過了工作的範疇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"我會確保我做的工作是我喜歡的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不喜歡卡西米爾，那裡太嘈雜，人也太聒噪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原以為我也不會喜歡謝拉格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，謝拉格不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"這個理由不錯，一個好的退休生活地點是非常重要的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不約而同地，雙方都各退了幾步。\n他們意識到了，要解決對手的話，剛才的進攻是沒有用的。\n他們必須拿出更多的本領。\n鐧將劍隨手丟在一邊，從腰間抽出了她的雙鐧。\nSharp也卸下手中的盾丟在一邊，雙手握住了手中的刀。\n蒼翠的樹上，一根樹枝不堪積雪的重壓，“啪”的一聲斷裂。\n同一時間，Sharp和鐧也消失在了他們上一秒所處的位置。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g2_temple_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呀，真是讓我不知道說你什麼好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你居然是繞過所有人，從山腳下一路攀登上來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸嘿嘿，只有這樣才能見到姐姐嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才說，是一個叫博士的人讓你來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他讓你來做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士說，我應該待在姐姐你的身邊，在必要的時候保護你，或者帶你逃跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"必要的時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士說，老哥他可能會對姐姐你做不好的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，我是這麼想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老哥他有自己的想法，我攔不住他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是如果老哥的想法最後會傷害到你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我拼了命也會阻止他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"恩雅忽然明白了那個博士為什麼要將妹妹送到自己的身邊。\n保護、逃跑——這兩個理由是說給妹妹聽的。\n那個博士知道自己的想法，他也知道，自己見到妹妹這個行為本身，就會產生出意義。\n讓恩希亞來保護她？\n讓恩希亞帶她逃跑？\n不，恰恰相反。\n她才是那個應該保護恩希亞的人。\n她才是那個應該帶著恩希亞逃跑的人。\n她才是那個——應當戰鬥的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亞，我過去給你編的手繩，你還戴著呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然戴著，我還會一直戴下去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抽空，我編一條新的給你吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，恩希亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你願意幫姐姐一個忙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陪著我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g5_guestroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（外面很安靜，但那兩個看守應該還在。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（窗戶......從這個角度要想不被發現，得先把外面的護衛引走。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（巡邏的路線......每天會有五次經過這附近，應該很快就要過來了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不行，不能強行破壞鎖，但如果能撬開......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......應該還有機會。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的護衛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......恩希歐迪斯大人......這次一定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（——來了！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的護衛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"三家......衝突看來免不了......但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的護衛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......布朗陶家的......燒......休露絲夫人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（露絲......？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（露絲，露絲怎麼了......？難道出了什麼事？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可惡，還是太遠了，聽不清楚。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......不，一定沒事的。我得先找辦法離開這裡，然後去找露絲和大夫人......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你們是什麼人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快攔住他們——咕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（從門口傳來的聲音，發生了什麼......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤卡坦，你有沒有事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"露絲？！你怎麼會在這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼會在這裡？別說傻話了，當然是因為你在這啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人都靠不住，只有靠我來救你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是這太危險了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"露絲，你帶了多少人來？你、你可以不用親自過來的，我絕不想你因為我而冒險......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤卡坦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再多說一句，我就揍你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽好了！你可以為我冒多大的風險，那我對你，就也同樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽好了，不許忘記！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不許再把我一個人丟下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"露絲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我不會這麼做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我當然知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，你沒事我就放心了......現在嘛，我們還有點其他事情，我答應了菈塔托絲，在救到你之後還要順便完成另一個任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任務？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布朗陶家戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休露絲夫人，希瓦艾什家的魏斯帶人殺過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，這就來了。具體的等下慢慢給你說，總之，我們的任務就是給希瓦艾什找些麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有......我還想去找個人，哎，這個之後再說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情況算不上太好，那個魏斯不算好對付......但你會幫我的對吧，尤卡坦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。只要你有需要，我就會一直在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g6_square"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收緊包圍圈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別讓阿克托斯衝上山道！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩爾羅契家戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺，我們快要被包圍了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼，看來靠衝的只能衝到這裡了嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯老爺，請投降吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶克家的小子，我不知道恩希歐迪斯給你灌了什麼迷魂湯讓你對他這麼死心塌地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們耶克家，在我佩爾羅契領的名氣也是響噹噹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果你居然選擇幫助恩希歐迪斯篡奪謝拉格！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"投降？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將阿克托斯老爺抓起來......儘量留活口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“山雪鬼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，希瓦艾什家的雜碎們，誰來和我一戰？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“山雪鬼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"......？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......極光？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道說——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"看來趕上了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"嗨。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"（拉了拉帽檐）","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐧不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你可算來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"忽然下雪，耽擱了一些工夫。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，謝拉格的雪對你這樣的外鄉人來說確實是個麻煩。"}]},{"label":"為了避開希瓦艾什家的耳目，花了一些時間。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，你來得正是時候！"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，既然援軍也已經來了，這下已經沒有什麼能阻止我們了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯，現在高興是否還太早了些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希歐迪斯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，許久不見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"確實是“許久不見”。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"真的是“許久不見”嗎？","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"你終於肯見我了。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然有不少話題想要與你交流，不過很遺憾，現在並不是時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希歐迪斯，你就等著吧，我馬上就會衝破你的包圍圈，救出聖女，向全謝拉格證明，你才是那個叛徒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拭目以待。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"戰士們，我佩爾羅契家自古以來的職責是什麼？"},{"type":"narration","text":"“是守護謝拉格不受外敵侵犯，和保護這片土地的安寧！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如今，他恩希歐迪斯想要對聖女不利，想要把聖女作為自己的工具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們佩爾羅契家能答應嗎！"},{"type":"narration","text":"“不能！不能！！絕不答應！！！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"援軍已到，隨我衝上聖山，打倒恩希歐迪斯，營救聖女！"},{"type":"narration","text":"“打倒恩希歐迪斯，營救聖女！”\n“打倒恩希歐迪斯，營救聖女！！”\n“打倒恩希歐迪斯，營救聖女！！！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g2_temple_indoor"},{"type":"narration","text":"b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“山雪鬼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖女大人，您要幹什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要下山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希歐迪斯老爺說過——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我做事，什麼時候需要恩希歐迪斯同意？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“叮鈴”“叮鈴”“叮鈴——”\n空靈的鈴聲在寺院中迴響。\n下一刻，除了恩希亞，所有在場的人全都倒在了地上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐......好厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅兒，雅兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖女大人，您怎麼知道我在的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這個丫頭機靈得很，我就猜你在哪裡躲著看呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要下山一趟，這裡就麻煩你幫我處理一下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，您要把這麼麻煩的事情丟給我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為還有更麻煩的事在等著我呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然您這麼說，那就沒辦法啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g13_mountpath_s"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，每一次的聖女選拔，我都會扮成侍女，在暗中觀察這一批接受試煉的女孩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是那一年的第六個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本我沒對你抱什麼期望，因為最近的聖女變得越來越無聊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們或許擁有堅韌的體魄，卻沒有足夠強大的意志，最終只能成為長老團的傀儡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我時而也會覺得，是不是因為謝拉格太過封閉，使得她們，使得這個國家的人們，都變得停滯不前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很有意思，恩雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你不是為了成為聖女而來的，你是因為憤怒和失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當你頂著風雪走在聖山的山道上，當你即使精疲力盡也不願意放棄的時候，你腦中所想的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是成為聖女，不是成為耶拉岡德的代理人，不是為謝拉格人謀福祉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想的，是對你哥哥的失望，是對另外兩大家族的厭惡，是你要成為聖女嚇他們所有人一跳的憤怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更讓我驚喜的，是你對謝拉格的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，實際上應該說是你們兄妹帶給我的驚喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的哥哥很早就給出了一份答卷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，也一直在探索屬於你自己的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些年，你忍受住了聖女在蔓珠院所受的冷遇，主動尋找著各種幫助人民的方法，這些都成為了你的食糧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而現在，這些食糧轉化為了你的力量，你在這次動亂中沒有迷失自己，你做出了你的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祝賀你，我的孩子，我的代理人，我的朋友，我的姐妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原諒我無法為你指明道路。我曾經冒失地將這片土地打上我的烙印，直到現在，我都在後悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但至少在此刻，讓我為你的啟程之路增添幾分色彩吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"寂靜的過道上，雅兒面帶笑容，輕輕拍了兩下手。\n“啪”“啪”\n然後，一切都改變了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g11_snowylane"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不痛不癢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦萊絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_261_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦萊絲，或許阿克托斯老爺也有對不起你的地方——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但恩希歐迪斯他也不是什麼好人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦萊絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_261_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦萊絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_261_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝拉格必須要改變了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦萊絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_261_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是為了讓像你這樣出色的戰士不再白白犧牲！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要逼我，瓦萊絲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦萊絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_261_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這句話應該是我來說，古羅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩人各退一步，擺好架勢。\n他們知道，今天，恐怕必須要有一個人在這裡倒下了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦萊絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_261_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏雲......散了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g7_thoroughfare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，真是頑強，我小看你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，即使你們打敗我也沒有任何意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是無法阻止老爺的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一直以來，夫人......菈塔托絲姐姐對謝拉格有自己的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也想要人們往前走，希望能讓人們過上好日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，她沒有力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"於是，她成了你們口中那個詭計多端的菈塔托絲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許在你們看來，姐姐只是一個絆腳石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在我眼中，她永遠是我最敬愛的姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤卡坦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對你們也沒有個人恩怨，只要你們願意放棄，我可以保證你們的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我不會讓我和露絲成為恩希歐迪斯與大夫人談判的籌碼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希瓦艾什家的魏斯，閃開，不然，我會殺了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這句話應該是我來說，布朗陶家的尤卡坦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，你必須留在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤卡坦，加油啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖山那邊，烏雲怎麼裂開了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g13_mountpath_s"},{"type":"narration","text":"Sharp轉身，看著緩緩將雙鐧收回腰間的鐧。\n在他們身邊，如同天災短暫地掃過大地，斷裂的樹木，粉碎的岩石隨處可見。\n他沒有注意到自己的刀從手中滑落，因為，他的右手已經失去了知覺。\n他輸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三個月內，最好不要過度使用你的右手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你的忠告，看起來該請個短時間的病假了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起來並不沮喪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"這場戰鬥的輸贏並不能改變任何事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"我將你在這裡拖到了現在，我的任務已經完成了，其餘的人會完成剩下的部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"工作結束了，我下班了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工作對你來說，有這麼重要？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"對我來說，保持職業精神非常重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"找到一個好的雇主並不容易，至少這份工作我很在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，你從一開始就知道我是來拖延你的，而現在，你並不沮喪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也有些好奇，即使你攔住我，你們能做到什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，恩希歐迪斯的保鏢並不像傳聞中那樣只為他掃平一切敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"人們只知道是恩希歐迪斯買下了黑騎士，卻沒想過，這同樣也是黑騎士承認了恩希歐迪斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"你和恩希歐迪斯同樣驕傲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我會記住你的名字，Sharp。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"你大可以不記住我，但你可以記住博士的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"聖山那邊，發生了什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g13_mountpath_s"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰士們，列陣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩爾羅契家戰士們","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全軍——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“山雪鬼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家戰士們","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生了什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"時間彷彿在這一刻靜止。\n只有聖女的腳步聲在山間回蕩。\n風雪早已在不知何時停止。\n天上的烏雲像是在為她開路一般，緩緩向兩邊散開。\n穿過烏雲的光照在聖女行走的道路上，一時間，竟讓人產生錯覺，聖女正從天上走來。\n又或者說，這並非錯覺。\n神跡......\n這是神跡。\n這是神跡！！！\n在這一刻，所有戰士的心中都只有一個想法。\n那就是——向聖女獻上他們最虔誠的信仰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g5_guestroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍女","speakerId":"avg_npc_269","isRemote":false,"text":"雅兒姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"退下吧，我來照顧大長老。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍女","speakerId":"avg_npc_269","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，正殿雖然經過了許多次修繕，但它的年紀，可能也沒有比祂小多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大長老這個名頭，也差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會有人否認，是蔓珠院的存在才讓謝拉格以團結的姿態存續到今天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，過去正確的事，現在未必正確。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果無法適應時代，無論多麼強大，也只有被拋棄的命運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝拉格不應止步於此，至少，有人不這麼希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做個好夢，大長老。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦你了，辛苦你們了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g11_snowylane"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦萊絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_261_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那難道是，神跡......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g7_thoroughfare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖山那邊發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人，收隊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生了......什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......難道是耶拉岡德降下的神跡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g7_thoroughfare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝拉格......這下會變成什麼樣子呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真刺眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有些好奇，這也在你那個博士的計畫之內嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"老實說，如果這確實在博士的計畫內，或者哪怕他至少預料到了這樣的可能性......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"就算幹員們普遍喜歡宣稱博士無所不能，但是這也太過誇張了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，我怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別怕，恩希亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐會保護你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐......會保護謝拉格。"},{"type":"narration","text":"山道上的所有士兵，在這一刻都放下了武器。\n自己畢生信仰的雪山之神已經顯現了神跡，在祂面前，一切的鬥爭都顯得那麼可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......佩爾羅契家家主，阿克托斯·佩爾羅契，向祂的代理人，聖女大人，獻上最誠摯的祝福。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"短暫的沉默後，他緩緩向聖女行了一個禮，而後，單膝跪下。\n在場所有佩爾羅契家的戰士，也隨著他的動作盡數跪下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......恩希歐迪斯，你現在，後悔嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你指什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有聽從我最初的意見，以及，將那個博士請來謝拉格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你認為我們輸了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為，在你的觀念中，這就算輸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在過去，確實是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在今天......未必。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"恩希歐迪斯邁動腳步。\n他緩緩走出人群，同樣來到聖女的面前，單膝跪下，獻上了自己的祝福。\n隨後，希瓦艾什家的戰士，也盡數跪下。\n雪山事變，以一種誰都沒有預料到的方式，落下了帷幕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
